  "instructions": [
    "In a large pan, heat 2 tbsp of oil over medium heat.",
    "Add onion and garlic and sauté until softened, about 5 min.",
    "Add dumplings and cook until browned on all sides, about 8 min.",
    "Meanwhile, mix lemon juice, egg, and double cream in a bowl.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer over low heat, stirring constantly.",
    "Reduce heat to low and cook until sauce thickens, about 5 min.",
    "Warm the lotus leaf wraps according to package instructions.",
    "Assemble the wraps by placing cooked dumplings in the center, spooning over the creamy sauce, and garnishing with chopped fresh dill.",
